4. BIOMETRIC ATTENDANCE
------------------------------------------------------------
attendance_devices
attendance_device_employees
attendance_logs

- Machine sends only employee + punch datetime
- No IN/OUT type stored
- System determines IN/OUT from duty/shift
- Raw logs cannot be manually edited


