============================================================
KEY PRINCIPLES
============================================================

- Everything is data-driven.
- Roster is optional.
- General duty is supported.
- Rotating/cross-midnight shifts are supported.
- Biometric logs have no IN/OUT classification.
- Attendance cannot be directly edited.
- Corrections happen through employee applications.
- Leave balances are transaction-based and auditable.
- Leave year and payroll period are independent.
- Payroll cycles are fully configurable.
- Absent days are not payable.
- Approved payroll is locked.
- Historical salary, attendance, leave and payroll data is preserved.
- Audit trail is maintained for important changes.
